RTS0 game data license
======================

Unless a file or folder says otherwise, the art, audio, maps and other game
data in assets/, audio/ and data/maps/ come from 0 A.D. by Wildfire Games and
are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported
license (CC BY-SA 3.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Attribution: 0 A.D. (https://play0ad.com), Copyright (C) Wildfire Games and
the 0 A.D. contributors. The full contributor list is in 0 A.D.'s own
credits (binaries/data/mods/public/gui/credits/texts/ in the 0 A.D. source).

RTS0 converted these files (meshes baked to GLB, DDS textures to PNG, maps to
JSON, animation clips re-exported). The converted files are adaptations and
are shared under the same CC BY-SA 3.0 license.

Exceptions:

- assets/fonts/DejaVuSansMono.ttf: DejaVu Fonts license (Bitstream Vera
  derivative), https://dejavu-fonts.github.io/License.html
- assets/fonts/LinBiolinum_*.ttf: Linux Libertine/Biolinum, SIL Open Font
  License 1.1 or GPL with font exception, https://libertine-fonts.org
- Files under assets/materials/ and shaders/ written for RTS0, and textures
  RTS0 generates itself (for example assets/textures/noise/), are part of the
  RTS0 code and covered by the GPL-2.0-or-later terms in the top-level LICENSE.
